# FORLORN HOPE: three gulpers close off three ways. The one in the roots is
# over 50 tiles long, its head four screens above the passage its body
# blocks. Feeding one a volunteer clears that one only.
game forlorn
cheat start 1
wait 20
cheat no_foes
expect alive17 == 3
expect solid100100 == 1
expect solid153100 == 1
expect solid100034 == 1
expect solid50070 == 1
# the sump's gulper: walk into its head
cheat class 0
wait 2
cheat place 325 925
hold RIGHT 40
expect phase == 2
expect cause == 4
expect alive17 == 2
expect solid100034 == 0
expect solid110035 == 0
expect solid50070 == 1
expect solid120100 == 1
